(7513225, 1199530, 97225, '<td valign="top">Good work.</td>', 'Good work.', '2017-05-11 22:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513227, 1199184, 28742, '<td valign="top">I think this will take the blue. Great idea and generally well executed. My top pick anyway. :)</td>', 'I think this will take the blue. Great idea and generally well executed. My top pick anyway. :)', '2017-05-11 23:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513230, 1199462, 28742, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool! :) I like the concept. Execution is pretty good as well. Nitpicks would be little details about the connector in the neck, the apple on the plate - I just don''t like how it''s floating at an angle like that and the cable''s a little ratty looking. Still in all, this is one of my top picks for it''s overall appeal.</td>', 'Pretty cool! :) I like the concept. Execution is pretty good as well. Nitpicks would be little details about the connector in the neck, the apple on the plate - I just don''t like how it''s floating at an angle like that and the cable''s a little ratty looking. Still in all, this is one of my top picks for it''s overall appeal.', '2017-05-11 23:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513231, 1199494, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene. Several nitpicks with the editing: The skull''s texture and color could be a little better blended and the eyes dark-to-light assuming there''s no light source in the skull. The spaceship seems out of place in the whole scene except to fulfill the challenge topic. Maybe nix the sailing ship and replace with another spacecraft or something. <br/> <br/>Just trying to provide constructive criticism in the spirit of learning. Take it for what it''s worth, along with my appreciation of your participation.</td>', 'Very cool scene. Several nitpicks with the editing: The skull''s texture and color could be a little better blended and the eyes dark-to-light assuming there''s no light source in the skull. The spaceship seems out of place in the whole scene except to fulfill the challenge topic. Maybe nix the sailing ship and replace with another spacecraft or something.  Just trying to provide constructive criticism in the spirit of learning. Take it for what it''s worth, along with my appreciation of your participation.', '2017-05-11 23:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513232, 1199495, 28742, '<td valign="top">This could be a book cover. Or a YouTube thumbnail. ;-) Pretty wild. I suspect it will get hammered by voters for being too extreme on the graphics side, but who knows. Sometimes the visual impact can overwhelm technical biases. :)</td>', 'This could be a book cover. Or a YouTube thumbnail. ;-) Pretty wild. I suspect it will get hammered by voters for being too extreme on the graphics side, but who knows. Sometimes the visual impact can overwhelm technical biases. :)', '2017-05-11 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513233, 1199482, 28742, '<td valign="top">Front page stuff, right there. I''m wondering what the original(s) looks like. This one is definitely has one of the most visually appealing, I think. Great job!</td>', 'Front page stuff, right there. I''m wondering what the original(s) looks like. This one is definitely has one of the most visually appealing, I think. Great job!', '2017-05-11 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513234, 1199266, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest - I like the concept and even the editing. I think what detracts for me is the cartoonish nature of the dragon, compared to the rest of the scene. I''d actually bump it a point if the dragon was removed and everything else, including the composition was roughly the same.</td>', 'I''ll be honest - I like the concept and even the editing. I think what detracts for me is the cartoonish nature of the dragon, compared to the rest of the scene. I''d actually bump it a point if the dragon was removed and everything else, including the composition was roughly the same.', '2017-05-11 23:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513235, 1198938, 28742, '<td valign="top">Meanwhile, at the bottom of the sea... :) This is surprisingly excellent in it''s simplicity.</td>', 'Meanwhile, at the bottom of the sea... :) This is surprisingly excellent in it''s simplicity.', '2017-05-11 23:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513236, 1199530, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very cool spacescape! Only detraction for me is that you may have overdone it with the number and lack of variety of spaceships and the angle of that one is particularly triggering to my OCD. ;-) Lots to like about this, though. Good luck! :)</td>', 'Very cool spacescape! Only detraction for me is that you may have overdone it with the number and lack of variety of spaceships and the angle of that one is particularly triggering to my OCD. ;-) Lots to like about this, though. Good luck! :)', '2017-05-11 23:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513237, 1199523, 28742, '<td valign="top">You went to town on this! :) I love everything about it except the aliens/alien ships. Creative use of flowers(?), but they just don''t do it for me. That said, the destructive editing is very impressive. :)</td>', 'You went to town on this! :) I love everything about it except the aliens/alien ships. Creative use of flowers(?), but they just don''t do it for me. That said, the destructive editing is very impressive. :)', '2017-05-11 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
