(7513309, 1199482, 147314, '<td valign="top">Anita, congrats on the Blue but if I may be honest, I don''t have a clue of why this image did win. It''s a lovely colourful image but IMHO it has little to do with the topic of the challenge, but probably that is my lack of imagination :-)<br/>But somehow it is proof that things are changing on DPC, the more arty your image the better it scores. But again, congrats with the ribbon, I always love your images!</td>', 'Anita, congrats on the Blue but if I may be honest, I don''t have a clue of why this image did win. It''s a lovely colourful image but IMHO it has little to do with the topic of the challenge, but probably that is my lack of imagination :-)But somehow it is proof that things are changing on DPC, the more arty your image the better it scores. But again, congrats with the ribbon, I always love your images!', '2017-05-12 05:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
