(7513317, 1199493, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Whilst this appears very similar to your other recent entry in terms of the challenge itself, it is very effective. I like the colours in the light and the way it encircles your model. I find her pose a little awkward but there is also an air of mystique about it so it does work. I quite like the cropping but the heavy post of the pier is rather acting as a barrier. The lihting that falls on your model is very effective it enhances her appearance. All in ll another good attempt, well done Ronnie</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge Whilst this appears very similar to your other recent entry in terms of the challenge itself, it is very effective. I like the colours in the light and the way it encircles your model. I find her pose a little awkward but there is also an air of mystique about it so it does work. I quite like the cropping but the heavy post of the pier is rather acting as a barrier. The lihting that falls on your model is very effective it enhances her appearance. All in ll another good attempt, well done Ronnie', '2017-05-12 09:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
